body:
Dear {{recipient_name}},

This is to confirm that the following child is transitioning from {{nursery_name}} to primary school (Reception).

Child details
  Name:            {{child_name}}
  Nursery ID:      {{pupil_id}}
  Date of birth:   {{date_of_birth}}
  Current room:    {{room}}
  Key person:      {{key_person_name}}

Destination
  Primary school:  {{destination_school}}
  Expected start:  {{start_date}}

Parent / carer
  Name:            {{parent_name}}
  Email:           {{parent_email}}

Transition record
  Report sent:           {{report_sent}} ({{report_sent_date}})
  Reception teacher visit: {{teacher_visit}}
  Activities completed:    {{activities}}
  Notes:                   {{notes}}

Please retain this notification for your records. If anything above needs correcting, reply to this email.

Kind regards,
{{sender_name}}
{{nursery_name}}
